WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.892
Production PostgreSQL supports REFRESH MATERIALIZED
VIEW CONCURRENTLY under specific conditions

00:00:07.743 --> 00:00:13.355
An appropriate unique index is required Concurrent
refresh is an

00:00:13.381 --> 00:00:19.168
availability technique It does not remove the need
for a refresh policy

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.378
freshness metadata or monitoring
